{"speciesId":286,"names":{"fr":"Chapignon","es":"Breloom","en":"Breloom","ja":"キノガッサ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"BRELOOM closes in on its foe with light and sprightly footwork, then throws punches with its stretchy arms. This POKéMON’s fighting technique puts boxers to shame."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"The seeds ringing BRELOOM’s tail are made of hardened toxic spores. It is horrible to eat the seeds. Just taking a bite of this POKéMON’s seed will cause your stomach to rumble."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It scatters spores from holes in the cap on its head. It loves warm and humid climates. It feeds on trees and plants in fields and forests."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The seeds on its tail are made of toxic spores. It knocks out foes with quick, virtually invisible punches."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The seeds on its tail are made of toxic spores. It knocks out foes with quick, virtually invisible punches."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It scatters poisonous spores and throws powerful punches while its foe is hampered by inhaled spores."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It scatters poisonous spores and throws powerful punches while its foe is hampered by inhaled spores."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses petits bras s’étendent quand il donne un coup de poing. Son talent égale celui d’un boxeur pro."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses petits bras s’étendent quand il donne un coup de poing. Son talent égale celui d’un boxeur pro."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses petits bras s’étendent quand il donne un coup de poing. Son talent égale celui d’un boxeur pro."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus cortos brazos se expanden cuando da puñetazos. Tiene una técnica pugilística muy depurada."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"短い 腕は パンチを 出すとき グーンと 伸びる。プロボクサー 顔負けの テクニックを 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il frappe de toutes ses forces ses ennemis étourdis par ses spores empoisonnées."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Esparce esporas venenosas muy nocivas y asesta puñetazos de gran intensidad a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It scatters poisonous spores and throws powerful punches while its foe is hampered by inhaled spores."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"毒の 胞子を ばらまき 吸いこんで 苦しむ 相手に 強烈な パンチを くらわせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Chapignon se rapproche de son ennemi en se servant de son jeu de jambes, puis donne des coups de poing avec ses bras élastiques. La technique de combat de ce Pokémon est digne des meilleurs boxeurs."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Breloom se acerca al enemigo realizando un juego de piernas ágil y enérgico. Y, a continuación, le da unos puñetazos con los brazos elásticos que tiene. Las técnicas de lucha que usa dejan en ridículo al boxeador más profesional."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Breloom closes in on its foe with light and sprightly footwork, then throws punches with its stretchy arms. This Pokémon’s fighting technique puts boxers to shame."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"軽やかな フットワークで 敵に 近づき 伸び縮みする 腕で パンチを 繰り出す。 ボクサー 顔負けの テクニックの 持ち主。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les graines autour de la queue de Chapignon sont des spores toxiques. Elles sont totalement immangeables. Une simple bouchée d’une graine de ce Pokémon peut causer de grandes douleurs à l’estomac."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Las semillas que Breloom tiene prendidas de la cola están formadas por sólidas esporas tóxicas. Comérselas puede resultar fatal. Hasta el más mínimo bocado puede hacerte polvo el estómago."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The seeds ringing Breloom’s tail are made of hardened toxic spores. It is horrible to eat the seeds. Just taking a bite of this Pokémon’s seed will cause your stomach to rumble."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"シッポの タネは 毒の 胞子が 固まって できた ものなので 食べたら 大変だ。 一口で お腹が グルグル 鳴りだすぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":286,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine